SMSHub Desktop Icon — Placeholder
====================================

Required icon files (place in electron/resources/):

1. icon.icns — macOS (use iconutil to convert from iconset)
2. icon.ico — Windows (256x256 multi-res ICO)
3. icons/ directory — Linux PNGs:
   - icons/16x16.png
   - icons/32x32.png
   - icons/48x48.png
   - icons/64x64.png
   - icons/128x128.png
   - icons/256x256.png
   - icons/512x512.png

Design: Same as mobile icon — dark background (#030712) with blue (#2563eb) message bubble.

For tray icon: Use a simpler, monochrome version:
- macOS: 22x22 "Template" image (white on transparent, system handles dark/light)
- Windows: 16x16 or 32x32 ICO
- Linux: 22x22 PNG

Generate with:
  npx electron-icon-builder --input=icon-source.png --output=resources/
